{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "c805fbb27695947766bacc0eac16bb8eff8538f73e6c9fea301ed12b4b784414", "ja": "こら～っ！　……はぁ。あのふたりったら、\n本当にすばしっこいんだから。", "zh": "喂——！……唉，那两个人真是的，\n跑得也太快了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1001_p", "source_sha256": "51a6cf3a5bdb4b137e9a887db5ed3b51566e608bb8acbe5580f061894fb25d09", "ja": "律子、お疲れさま。\n騒がしかったけど、何かあったのか？", "zh": "律子，辛苦了。\n刚才挺吵闹的，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "c0916ebd59c8c5969c4b0ac9f0ec4e85a1ebf4b223a1a5ff720ff39a738915b1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。ちょっとふたりほど、\n脱獄犯を出してしまいまして……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。刚才不小心放跑了两名越狱犯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3d3467671f31a73f79f6ef4488a5d25db3ce0ca260c64e08e246088d4b9e475a", "ja": "ん？　脱獄犯？", "zh": "嗯？越狱犯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "99c6ff46669864143105a83cff7da4a081ad62cf6ed9c04c43e20b4fb74ea6ec", "ja": "亜美と真美です。ふたりとも、私が衣装合わせを\nしているところに突然やってきたんですよ。", "zh": "是亚美和真美。她们两个突然跑到我试穿演出服的地方来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "9ba4fa74ee52a037eec801c7dae6a35d8ee01c55b939aa98e2b91469f8ec6c4c", "ja": "なんとかイタズラは阻止できましたけど、\nお説教の前に逃げられてしまって……。", "zh": "虽然总算阻止了她们的恶作剧，但在说教之前就被她们逃掉了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1f633538842ec6bf4baa2ae3b6fb3c02d082c10a2f61b8d77096fc6f406f1fe3", "ja": "ああ、脱獄犯ってのはそういうことか。\nその衣装だと、言い得て妙だな。", "zh": "啊，原来“越狱犯”指的是这个啊。\n穿着那身服装，还真是贴切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "91f3194f278225e65e14c2fd08ce079dcd4698a22becdf46d92e931d54a26f6d", "ja": "ふふっ。そう言ってもらえるってことは、\nちゃんと看守っぽく見えてるってことでいいですか？", "zh": "呵呵。你这么说，是不是就说明我看起来确实很像看守了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "721cf09af88d760282d17eaeadfc3ad37b78327efbb307d970f49edf497625ee", "ja": "バッチリだよ。それに、その髪型……\n雰囲気出すために変えたのか？", "zh": "非常像。而且，你这个发型……\n是为了营造气氛特意换的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "0403274b8492a7e8692b94c7fa1ebbabf4d49e116bf0b2ce4fd5b4a0b37a1378", "ja": "はい。看守ってクールなイメージがあるでしょ？\nこの髪型なら、凛々しさを強調できそうだなって。", "zh": "是的。看守给人的印象很酷，对吧？\n我觉得这个发型应该能更突出英气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "9c2eeda332e3eadd7f849307633908c1ca217f4e770ed64cd795036055f530f8", "ja": "もちろん、普段の髪型でも良かったんですけど……\nどうでしょう。これはこれで……アリだと思います？", "zh": "当然，平时的发型也没问题，不过……\n你觉得怎么样？我觉得这样也挺不错的，你说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fb5b2036df97c3c2d6709101ddb2218fba3d4e253d574028a03a45cad4eeb30e", "ja": "ああ、大アリだよ！　より締まったというか、\n魅力を引き出せてると思う！", "zh": "啊，当然可以！该说是更精神了吧，\n我觉得这样更能展现你的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "2a203507dc89007c2aa8aa7f28cd9bb8f152c45c10c463fcf2107b4f099fdf17", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　いざ褒められると、\nちょっと照れくさいですね。でも、ホッとしました。", "zh": "是、是吗？突然被这样夸，还真有点不好意思。不过，我也放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "01323eccb689d16765ec961e5d501777ec85447e7e74c63f415c8f97dbd9c8dc", "ja": "いろんな選択肢がある中での、この髪型だったので。\n実は試着の直前ギリギリまで悩んだんです。", "zh": "因为在各种各样的选择中，最终选了这个发型。\n其实直到试穿前的最后一刻，我都还在纠结呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a7e694942bdad4ffcf2b9ab068ee9a9b6b4abdee673dae7ead698675bc44c5d9", "ja": "センスが問われるもんな。でも、\n悩んだ甲斐はあったんじゃないか？", "zh": "这可是很考验品味的。不过，纠结了这么久也算值得了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "816dc2cd9d975f69427d6be9237b30f64aac56c99863053d1cc8b194fa14ed53", "ja": "ええ、色々勉強になりました。{$P$}\nのお墨付きももらえましたしね！", "zh": "是的，学到了很多。还得到了{$P$}\n的认可呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "c54c34e23aedd81bfd1c69de1c191b905bde5257e732a258ab4823f363e12277", "ja": "あとは振る舞い方だなぁ。一応、そっちの方も\nいろいろ考えてはいるんですけど……でも、今度は。", "zh": "接下来就是举止方面了呢。虽然这方面\n我也考虑了各种各样的情况……不过，这次嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "eb71d9fcc4bee0881d79d0cc7e0c1b059301ab245765f61276516581efe551b8", "ja": "一緒に考えてもらっていいですか？　髪型は\n一人で考えた分、今度は知恵をお借りしようかと。", "zh": "可以请你和我一起想想吗？发型已经是我一个人想的了，这次想借助一下你的智慧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d94d003b56421a238131378918ec110591b440ced3b81186ab04cfeb7937eb81", "ja": "もちろんだ。何から何まで律子任せでは\n申し訳ないしな。考えよう、二人で。", "zh": "当然可以。什么都让律子一个人操心也不太好。一起想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0274_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "4a2e628c34ccd2bb6590f53c86c02925536d91982d3dbad4c1d4df339e6ea311", "ja": "ふふっ、ではお言葉に甘えて。よろしくお願いします。\n……あ、あと、脱獄犯の捕獲も手伝ってくださいね！", "zh": "呵呵，那我就恭敬不如从命了。请多关照。\n……啊，还有，也请帮忙抓捕越狱犯哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
